    "title": "New charges filed against man accused of crashing into Raleigh officer, warrant shows - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matthew Sockol ,\n9 hours ago RALEIGH, N.C. (WNCN) — The man accused of crashing into a Raleigh police officer with a stolen vehicle earlier this month is facing new charges, a warrant shows. According to the Raleigh Police Department, officers were investigating vehicle break-ins on Aug. 16 around 3:30 a.m. on Thistlebrook Court when they identified the suspect. The suspect fled the scene in a stolen vehicle, striking a police cruiser while driving off. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
